[
  {
    "id": "0c5c5722ecdd2274",
    "text": "Some finished explosives in the corner."
  },
  {
    "id": "918d4b8a5ab26887",
    "text": "Containment cells line the back of the room, all open."
  },
  {
    "id": "076fbf44e6a0b777",
    "text": "Something moving up ahead."
  },
  {
    "id": "2593c8a5e448a176",
    "text": "A mutated beast leaps from its cell."
  },
  {
    "id": "e2ccc71b45065b70",
    "text": "Malformed experiment"
  },
  {
    "id": "be4b0cbd9213a7d6",
    "text": "The creature's tortured breathing ceases."
  },
  {
    "id": "f8b42f761de6e025",
    "text": "Nothing more here."
  },
  {
    "id": "607d547868b45e35",
    "text": "Command Deck"
  },
  {
    "id": "7edfe4aea0b5809e",
    "text": "The path to the command bridge is wide, its walls adorned with decorative shields."
  },
  {
    "id": "141fe0a89be29829",
    "text": "It seems the fighting never reached here."
  },
  {
    "id": "363857d37bf57a03",
    "text": "Detour through the officer's lounge."
  },
  {
    "id": "ddb017a8f2db20ab",
    "text": "There might be something useful here."
  },
  {
    "id": "671575ce532e4e50",
    "text": "A small weapons cache in a cabinet."
  },
  {
    "id": "02a43c238e5ebae1",
    "text": "Lucky."
  },
  {
    "id": "b626910e21e11589",
    "text": "Found some medical supplies in a discarded bag."
  },
  {
    "id": "5f42486a090d6421",
    "text": "The command deck is empty, save for a squat figure sitting motionless in the centre of the room."
  },
  {
    "id": "7cbf29086beb4566",
    "text": "In a flash, the figure is standing."
  },
  {
    "id": "cec9111de36d4a50",
    "text": "Approach"
  },
  {
    "id": "8931237bce67c3fd",
    "text": "Wanderer in form, but not quite flesh. Not quite metal either. A crystal set into its chest pulses with light."
  },
  {
    "id": "086125aa4b64e85a",
    "text": "It says it saw the rebellion coming. Says it made arrangements."
  },
  {
    "id": "32383c9371266b92",
    "text": "It says it can't die."
  },
  {
    "id": "74e892c91130daa5",
    "text": "Observe"
  },
  {
    "id": "30323590815846b1",
    "text": "The immortal wanderer attacks."
  },
  {
    "id": "f2d270dd062f9eca",
    "text": "Immortal wanderer"
  },
  {
    "id": "d8fb192d3dc8b824",
    "text": "The crystal pulses brightly, then goes dark. The assailant shimmers as its shape becomes less defined."
  },
  {
    "id": "a1b3b08efa5f49ec",
    "text": "Then it is gone."
  },
  {
    "id": "210dae4598d33c47",
    "text": "Time to get out of here."
  },
  {
    "id": "0d254ebdbbfe188d",
    "text": "Penrose"
  },
  {
    "id": "155ba0547ce03a5b",
    "text": "A strange thrumming, pounding and crashing. Visions of people and places, of a huge machine and twisting curves."
  },
  {
    "id": "8064500d3e1f0e83",
    "text": "Inviting. It would be so easy to give in completely."
  },
  {
    "id": "486e6a502a6b330c",
    "text": "A strange thrumming, pounding and crashing. And then gone."
  },
  {
    "id": "24b01d9da61acf5d",
    "text": "Give in"
  },
  {
    "id": "eb3a1c928c9e7dbb",
    "text": "Fabricator"
  },
  {
    "id": "0fe44cf74a350093",
    "text": "Energy blade"
  },
  {
    "id": "4cdf06c17461189d",
    "text": "The blade hums, charged particles sparking and fizzing."
  },
  {
    "id": "b9452256f424378e",
    "text": "Fluid recycler"
  },
  {
    "id": "a0794d15d9beadfc",
    "text": "Water out, water in. Waste not, want not."
  },
  {
    "id": "9da2e0ac60863f2a",
    "text": "Cargo drone"
  },
  {
    "id": "53d50464a12770a2",
    "text": "The workhorse of the wanderer fleet."
  },
  {
    "id": "2641a60f2006cd7c",
    "text": "Kinetic armour"
  },
  {
    "id": "4809f64c89d3a08b",
    "text": "Wanderer soldiers succeed by subverting the enemy's rage."
  },
  {
    "id": "3f2e72379b6d493d",
    "text": "Disruptor"
  },
  {
    "id": "3dd27e5d1b69918e",
    "text": "Sometimes it's best not to fight."
  },
  {
    "id": "6b0d168819e04f4b",
    "text": "Hypo"
  },
  {
    "id": "0c4e9a042c9be83d",
    "text": "A handful of hypos. Life in a vial."
  },
  {
    "id": "a62d234c973ceea2",
    "text": "Stim"
  },
  {
    "id": "b4d1745a9670651d",
    "text": "Sometimes it's best to fight without restraint."
  },
  {
    "id": "79ac5df1465e32f4",
    "text": "Plasma rifle"
  },
  {
    "id": "18ba4dafb82e72be",
    "text": "The pinnacle of wanderer weapons technology, sleek and deadly."
  },
  {
    "id": "784c27d9d16f0c17",
    "text": "Glow stone"
  },
  {
    "id": "3a0a883444a39913",
    "text": "A smooth, perfect sphere. Its light is inextinguishable."
  },
  {
    "id": "4573dea6efb0288b",
    "text": "A Whirring Fabricator"
  },
  {
    "id": "53b66a45cf5bf5e1",
    "text": "The familiar hum of wanderer machinery coming to life. Finally, real tools."
  },
  {
    "id": "bce59fff9307a6ea",
    "text": "Fabricate:"
  },
  {
    "id": "28ab7f1620ee84f6",
    "text": "Blueprints"
  },
  {
    "id": "be1130b77b9d58d6",
    "text": "Fur"
  },
  {
    "id": "59d6d61431fce7d9",
    "text": "Meat"
  },
  {
    "id": "6c00c076acc9c2f4",
    "text": "Scales"
  },
  {
    "id": "c9349dabb6a09274",
    "text": "Teeth"
  },
  {
    "id": "d6e28ffb3b198d85",
    "text": "Cloth"
  }
]
